# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000505> (Visual impairment)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000505> "Visual impairment (or vision impairment) is vision loss (of a person) to such a degree as to qualify as an additional support need through a significant limitation of visual capability resulting from either disease, trauma, or congenital or degenerative conditions that cannot be corrected by conventional means, such as refractive correction, medication, or surgery.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000505> "Visual impairment")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000505> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000504>)

