AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0005115> "A type of arrhythmia that originates above the ventricles, whereby the electrical impulse propagates down the normal His Purkinje system similar to normal sinus rhythm.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0005115> "Supraventricular arrhythmia")
