AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> "When an activity, substance, object, or behavior becomes a major focus of a person's life, excluding other activities, or has begun to harm the individual or others physically, mentally, or socially, it can be considered addictive behavior. A person can become addicted or compulsively engaged with anything.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> "Addictive behavior")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030858> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200241>)

