AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100547> "An abnormality of the forebrain, which has as its parts the telencephalon, diencephalon, lateral ventricles and third ventricle.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0100547> "Abnormal forebrain morphology")
