AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0430071> "Any deviation of the concentration of an orrganic compound from the normal range. An organic compound is defined as any compound that contains a carbon atom.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0430071> "Abnormal circulating organic compound concentration")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0430071> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0032180>)

