AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200241> "A repeating behavior that is either immediately unproductive or has negative long-term consequences. This includes harmful coping mechanisms such as addictive behavior and failure to control impulses and compulsions.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200241> "Recurrent maladaptive behavior")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_5200241> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000708>)

